# chthonia's workbench (plan §41.11a): the teaching layout, Thonny's shape.
# The editor above, and below it the REPL as the visible panel's first tab
# with Problems beside it; on the right the Variables view (chthonia's own
# code, chthonia.mad: the session's names). No project tree, no Outline, no
# Terminal or Output (F5's output is the REPL's). A pane visible at startup
# whose active View is the REPL starts its session when the window opens
# (init_view_es).
# The same format as profiles/default.layout.
@window main
pane editor tabs views source focus
pane sidebar right 25% tabs views variables
pane panel bottom 35% tabs views repl problems
